## Saving jar

this file explains the savind jar feature.

saving jar is a feature in the app to help couples to save money, the idea is to have a name a goal(How much money they want to save) and a limit date.
Users should be able to create a saving jar
Users should be able to edit a saving jar
Users should be able to list saving jar
users and the user parners should be able to list the saving jar.

Saving Jar model
    Id
    Name
    Date
    Goal
    User_id